icture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1321124227215491072/pIC0lG5M_normal.jpg", "displayName": "ThePersistence", "username": "ScottPresler"}, "content": "BREAKING NEWS\n\nI can\u2019t believe they reported this \u2014 they just told on themselves. \n\n\ud83d\udc49\u201cAllegheny County Elections Division Manager David Voye said Allegheny County does not have a system to verify citizenship for voters.\u201d\ud83d\udc48\n\nThe second-largest county in Pennsylvania DOES NOT", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 9807}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCE6YYAr", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 42, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8775699, "raw_content": "", "author": "HappyFunBall", "created": 1786501840954, "profile_picture": "OJtVzCV0AtAB", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "magnokor", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCE6YYAr.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/WmjAOyPb7kxY.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/WPlYcIiSFoOTwvj7.png", "width": 564, "content-type": "png", "height": 548}], "blurhash": "UEF#af2c-prD}?I=ozMxSgROI:%MrqNbt6V@", "full_resolution": [548, 564]}, "title": "\ud83e\udd14", "last_comment_created": 1786507152692, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 5, "score_up": 42, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCE6XRqS", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 106, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8775278, "raw_content": "I told her all the possible dangers of it.  That little kids are practically immune to covid anyways.  That of all the hundreds of bad things I heard about the clot shot, if even one of them is true, thats enough to not give it to her kids.  I gave her testimonies of our side's experts(top cardiologist McCullough, mRNA inventor R. Malone, Nobel winning virologist Luc Montangier, etc.), who are infinitely more credentialed that the other side's \"experts\"(fuck you Bill Gates).  \n\nI begged and pleaded, and you know how she replied?  \"Thanks, but we believe in science.  We'll decide on how to raise our kids.\"  Im thinking, \"Fucking bitch!  What part of all that I just told you isnt science?!\"  Thats what I wanted to say, but I decided it was pointless.  There was no getting through to those people.  \n\nI still think about that and it still pisses me off to this day.  The fucking smugness, man.  But her kids have been alright so far.  Nothing has happened to them yet.  Hopefully, thats the end of it.  ", "author": "MAG-n-KAG", "created": 1786483419157, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Spiritof2015", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Anti-vax story time:  I tried to warn my sister about giving her kids the clotshot.  ", "last_comment_created": 1786510259056, "content": "<p>I told her all the possible dangers of it.  That little kids are practically immune to covid anyways.  That of all the hundreds of bad things I heard about the clot shot, if even one of them is true, thats enough to not give it to her kids.  I gave her testimonies of our side's experts(top cardiologist McCullough, mRNA inventor R. Malone, Nobel winning virologist Luc Montangier, etc.), who are infinitely more credentialed that the other side's &quot;experts&quot;(fuck you Bill Gates).</p>\n<p>I begged and pleaded, and you know how she replied?  &quot;Thanks, but we believe in science.  We'll decide on how to raise our kids.&quot;  Im thinking, &quot;Fucking bitch!  What part of all that I just told you isnt science?!&quot;  Thats what I wanted to say, but I decided it was pointless.  There was no getting through to those people.</p>\n<p>I still think about that and it still pisses me off to this day.  The fucking smugness, man.  But her kids have been alright so far.  Nothing has happened to them yet.  Hopefully, thats the end of it.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 33, "score_up": 106, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2087081555789279706", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCE6Yp9i", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 35, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8775786, "raw_content": "", "author": "RYTHMICRIOT", "created": 1786505020094, "profile_picture": "unkHmy325PwW", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "_Liberty_Prime_", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCE6Yp9i.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/i/status/2087081555789279706", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Incompatible...", "last_comment_created": 1786505320677, "content